# UE gameplay implementation

- Replication-aware by default: authority simulates; clients predict cosmetics only.
- Put domain systems in `Plugins/GameFeatures/<Domain>/`; glue only in `Source/Aevum/`.
- Prefer Gameplay Tags, DataAssets, DataTables for tunable values.
- Enhanced Input / CommonUI for player-facing input and UI hooks.
- No console SDK includes, binaries, or platform-cert paths.
- Don’t commit `Binaries/`, `Intermediate/`, or plugin build products.
- If behavior changes a durable game rule, add/update a `Design/Decisions/` entry.
